WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.187
Hi Camille,

00:00:01.437 --> 00:00:13.865
I'm really sorry, but I can't come to your birthday on Saturday. My little sister broke her arm at the park yesterday and my parents are on holiday in Spain. So I'm the one looking after her this weekend.

00:00:14.115 --> 00:00:19.712
She's fine, don't worry! She has a blue cast and all her friends want to write on it.

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:30.694
I've already bought your present. Can we meet next week? I'm free on Tuesday and Thursday evening. We could go for a pizza, and I'll give you your present.

00:00:30.944 --> 00:00:35.602
Have a great evening and say hello to everyone!
Love,
Manon
